  "releaseNotes": "- Add .NET 9 and .NET 10 support.\n- Update Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http to 2.3.9, Serilog to 4.3.1 (3.1.1 for net7.0).\n- Fix nuspec duplicate key (targetFramework casing).\n- Fix README: IWebHostEnvironment, supported frameworks, WithClientIp headerName.\n- Improve README: clarify that WithClientIp uses \"x-forwarded-for\" header by default.\n- Add .editorconfig, UTF-8 BOM.\n- Extended test coverage.\n- Migrate tests to NUnit, FluentAssertions.\n- Tests: replace NSubstitute with Moq.",
